@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

actor Doctor
participant Router
participant SoapController
participant CitaController
participant RecetaController
participant NotaSoap
participant CitaEvento
participant Cita
participant Receta
participant "Storage / PDF" as Storage
participant Mail
database "SQLite / tablas clinicas" as DB

Doctor -> Router: GET /doctor/citas/{cita}/soap
Router -> SoapController: show(cita)
SoapController -> DB: cargar cita, nota, diagnosticos,\nenmiendas y signos previos
DB --> SoapController: datos de consulta
SoapController --> Doctor: view doctor.soap

Doctor -> Router: POST /doctor/citas/{cita}/soap/firmar
Router -> SoapController: firmar(request, cita)
SoapController -> DB: validar ownership y estado de cita
SoapController -> NotaSoap: upsert nota firmada
NotaSoap -> DB: INSERT / UPDATE notas_soap
SoapController -> DB: reemplazar diagnosticos de la nota
SoapController -> CitaEvento: create(tipo='soap_firmada')
CitaEvento -> DB: INSERT cita_eventos
SoapController --> Doctor: redirect /doctor/citas/{cita}/soap

Doctor -> Router: POST /doctor/citas/{id}/realizar
Router -> CitaController: realizar(id)
CitaController -> Cita: load cita + notaSoap
Cita -> DB: SELECT cita y nota SOAP
DB --> CitaController: datos de cita

alt SOAP no firmada
  CitaController --> Doctor: redirect /doctor/citas/{cita}/soap
else SOAP firmada
  CitaController -> Cita: update estado=realizada
  Cita -> DB: UPDATE citas_medicas
  note right of CitaController
    Se dispara CitaAtendida.
    El listener `GenerarOrdenCobroAlAtenderCita`
    usa `PagoService`.
  end note
  CitaController --> Doctor: back() + success
end

opt generar receta medica
  Doctor -> Router: POST /doctor/recetas
  Router -> RecetaController: store(request)
  RecetaController -> Cita: cargar cita y validar\nestado=realizada
  Cita -> DB: SELECT cita + paciente + doctor
  DB --> RecetaController: cita valida
  RecetaController -> Storage: generarPdfYGuardar()
  Storage --> RecetaController: pdf_path
  RecetaController -> Receta: create(...)
  Receta -> DB: INSERT recetas
  RecetaController -> Mail: send RecetaMedicaMail
  Mail --> RecetaController: enviado
  RecetaController --> Doctor: redirect /doctor/citas + success
end

@enduml
